  <div><span class="section-kicker">AKU</span><h2>Academic and professional education</h2><p>Aryabhatta Knowledge University (AKU), Patna, is a leading state university established by the Government of Bihar under the Aryabhatta Knowledge University Act, 2008 (Bihar Act 24 of 2008). The University is dedicated to promoting excellence in professional and technical education through quality teaching, innovative research, and industry-oriented academic programmes.</p></div>
